"elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Dernière mise à jour : 7 novembre 2026</p>","text_color":"#5B6780","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Source Sans 3","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.6,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]}]}]},{"id":"14de1b7","elType":"container","isInner":false,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_gap":{"column":"0","row":"0","isLinked":true,"unit":"px","size":0},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"60","right":"32","bottom":"100","left":"32","isLinked":false},"content_width":"boxed","boxed_width":{"unit":"px","size":1200,"sizes":[]},"padding_mobile":{"unit":"px","top":"40","right":"20","bottom":"70","left":"20","isLinked":false},"flex_align_items":"center","html_tag":"section"},"elements":[{"id":"21d08d9","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_gap":{"column":"32","row":"32","isLinked":true,"unit":"px","size":32},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"content_width":"full","width":{"unit":"px","size":820,"sizes":[]},"width_mobile":{"unit":"%","size":100,"sizes":[]},"width_tablet":{"unit":"%","size":100,"sizes":[]},"css_classes":"rcr-legal"},"elements":[{"id":"d65b4af","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>La protection de votre vie privée est importante pour nous. Cette politique explique comment notre site Web recueille, utilise, conserve et protège vos renseignements personnels lorsque vous le consultez ou communiquez avec nous.</p>","text_color":"#3F4B63","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Source Sans 3","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":17,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]},{"id":"2c473c2","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_gap":{"column":"10","row":"10","isLinked":true,"unit":"px","size":10},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"a63b72f","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"1. Renseignements recueillis","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#0E1B33","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":22,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]},{"id":"40dca86","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Selon les services utilisés, nous pouvons recueillir certains renseignements, notamment :</p><ul><li>Votre nom et prénom ;</li><li>Votre adresse courriel ;</li><li>Votre numéro de téléphone ;</li><li>Les renseignements nécessaires à une inscription ou à une demande d’information ;</li><li>Certaines données relatives à votre navigation sur notre site Web.</li></ul><p>Nous recueillons uniquement les renseignements nécessaires au fonctionnement de nos services et à nos communications avec vous.</p>","text_color":"#3F4B63","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Source Sans 3","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"486680b","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_gap":{"column":"10","row":"10","isLinked":true,"unit":"px","size":10},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"45f1ba5","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"2. Utilisation des renseignements","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#0E1B33","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":22,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]},{"id":"bb6b41e","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Vos renseignements personnels peuvent être utilisés pour :</p><ul><li>Répondre à vos questions et demandes ;</li><li>Gérer les inscriptions aux formations ;</li><li>Communiquer avec vous concernant nos activités ;</li><li>Améliorer le contenu et le fonctionnement de notre site Web ;</li><li>Respecter nos obligations légales.</li></ul><p>Nous ne vendons ni ne louons vos renseignements personnels à des tiers.</p>","text_color":"#3F4B63","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Source Sans 3","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"d3fdbb8","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_gap":{"column":"10","row":"10","isLinked":true,"unit":"px","size":10},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"8edbe27","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"3. Protection et conservation des renseignements","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#0E1B33","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":22,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]},{"id":"83c87a9","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Nous prenons des mesures raisonnables pour protéger vos renseignements personnels contre l’accès non autorisé, la perte, la divulgation ou l’utilisation inappropriée.</p><p>Vos renseignements sont conservés uniquement pendant la période nécessaire aux fins pour lesquelles ils ont été recueillis, sous réserve des obligations légales applicables.</p>","text_color":"#3F4B63","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Source Sans 3","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"b41644c","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_gap":{"column":"10","row":"10","isLinked":true,"unit":"px","size":10},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"7c511ec","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"4. Témoins de connexion (cookies)","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#0E1B33","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":22,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]},{"id":"5464d9e","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Notre site Web peut utiliser des témoins de connexion afin d’améliorer votre expérience de navigation, de faciliter certaines fonctionnalités et, le cas échéant, de mesurer l’achalandage du site.</p><p>Vous pouvez modifier les paramètres de votre navigateur pour limiter ou désactiver les témoins de connexion.</p>","text_color":"#3F4B63","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Source Sans 3","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"1e99678","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_gap":{"column":"10","row":"10","isLinked":true,"unit":"px","size":10},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"0ea36be","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"5. Partage des renseignements","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#0E1B33","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":22,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]},{"id":"26ce744","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Vos renseignements personnels ne sont communiqués à des tiers que lorsque cela est nécessaire à la prestation de nos services, avec votre consentement ou lorsque la loi l’autorise.</p><p>Certains fournisseurs technologiques peuvent également traiter des renseignements pour notre compte, notamment pour l’hébergement du site Web ou la gestion des inscriptions.</p>","text_color":"#3F4B63","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Source Sans 3","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"4866318","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_gap":{"column":"10","row":"10","isLinked":true,"unit":"px","size":10},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"ae1aa22","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"6. Vos droits","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#0E1B33","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":22,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]},{"id":"9193dfe","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Conformément aux lois applicables, vous pouvez notamment demander :</p><ul><li>L’accès aux renseignements personnels que nous détenons à votre sujet ;</li><li>La rectification de renseignements inexacts ou incomplets ;</li><li>Le retrait de votre consentement lorsque celui-ci constitue le fondement de leur utilisation.</li></ul><p>Pour exercer vos droits ou poser une question concernant cette politique, vous pouvez communiquer avec nous.</p>","text_color":"#3F4B63","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Source Sans 3","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"e4daf4d","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_gap":{"column":"10","row":"10","isLinked":true,"unit":"px","size":10},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"5b84e59","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"7. Responsable de la protection des renseignements personnels","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#0E1B33","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":22,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]},{"id":"8e05d1f","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Pour toute question, demande ou préoccupation concernant la confidentialité de vos renseignements personnels, veuillez communiquer avec notre responsable :</p><p><strong>Nom :</strong> Fethi Boudebza<br><strong>Courriel :</strong> <a href=\"mailto:rcrrivesud@outlook.com\">rcrrivesud@outlook.com</a><br><strong>Organisation :</strong> RCR Rive-Sud</p>","text_color":"#3F4B63","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Source Sans 3","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"e0b7977","elType":"container","isInner":true,"settings":{"flex_direction":"column","flex_gap":{"column":"10","row":"10","isLinked":true,"unit":"px","size":10},"padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"content_width":"full"},"elements":[{"id":"50be904","elType":"widget","widgetType":"heading","settings":{"title":"8. Modifications de la politique","header_size":"h2","title_color":"#0E1B33","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Montserrat","typography_font_weight":"700","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":22,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]},{"id":"f6b8d73","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p>Nous nous réservons le droit de modifier cette politique afin de tenir compte de l’évolution de nos pratiques ou des exigences légales.</p><p>Toute modification sera publiée sur cette page avec sa date de mise à jour.</p>","text_color":"#3F4B63","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Source Sans 3","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]}]},{"id":"1e2aab0","elType":"widget","widgetType":"text-editor","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong>Votre confiance est importante pour nous.</strong> Merci de visiter notre site et de contribuer à une communauté mieux informée et mieux préparée à intervenir en situation d’urgence.</p>","text_color":"#3F4B63","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Source Sans 3","typography_font_weight":"400","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":16,"sizes":[]},"typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.75,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[]}]}]}]